== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From 3. person form of ''[[tala#Icelandic|[að] tala]]'' "[[talk|[to] talk]]" (= ''[[talar|[þú] talar]]'', "[[speak|[you] speak]]") + ''[[þú#Icelandic|þú]]'' "[[you]]" + {{indef}} {{singular}} {{acc}} form of the language in question.

=== Phrase ===
'''[[tala]]r [[þú]]... ?''' (+ [[accusative]])

# [[do you speak]]... ?

